I read this post with interest because I've been wondering the same thing for more than a year: [_"The Gorman Paradox: Where Are All The AI-Generated Apps?_"](https://codemanship.wordpress.com/2025/12/14/the-gorman-paradox-where-are-all-the-ai-generated-apps/).

